WEBVTT

00:03.920 --> 00:06.880
All right, guys, now a quick talk about the temporary tables.

00:07.040 --> 00:09.680
To be honest, I never used this in my projects.

00:09.680 --> 00:14.760
If I need an intermediate results in one query, I can go and use the seats.

00:14.960 --> 00:20.400
And if my intermediate results is very important, then I put it in either view or CTAs.

00:20.680 --> 00:22.400
But it is a nice technique to learn.

00:22.440 --> 00:24.760
Maybe you can utilize it in one of your projects.
